      "message": "nit-pick: I would explicitly add a comment which calls out that want_affine is disabled if we wanna go for an energy_aware wakeup.\nIs that true, right?\nHow does this play with Joel\u0027s patch to use the slow-path for prefer_idle tasks... still have to better investigate...",
